player game for up to six players.\n\nInspired by Buckshot Roulette, it puts a different spin on the formula: everyone acts simultaneously. Each player has cards, chips, and a revolver \u2014 the tools to outsmart opponents and knock them out of the game.\n\nBet on the outcome of other players\u2019 shots, then spend your winnings on new cards and ammunition. Combine your actions, strike deals across the table, and betray your allies when the moment is right. With overlapping decisions and unexpected outcomes, every match can take a different turn.\n\nYour goal is simple: be the last player at the table.", "themes": [{"id": 40, "name": "Party"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/fools-trigger", "videos": [{"id": 199477, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "kmEb06pLfjI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kmEb06pLfjI", "title": "Fool\u2019s Trigger - Official Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kmEb06pLfjI/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}